{"articleNo":"174873","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=174873&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[7.11-7.13] 2017학년도 2학기 재입학 신청 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2017.06.26","hit":"4068","attachments":[{"name":"재입학 제출서류.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=174873&attachNo=5300"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong></strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><strong><u><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">2017학년도 2학기 재입학 신청 안내</font></span></u></strong></span></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><strong><u></u></strong></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><strong><u></u></strong></span></p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p></span><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">2017학년도 2학기 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong>재입학</strong></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">에 관한 사항을 아래와 같이 안내하오니 재입학 하고자 하는 자는 </span></font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">신청</span></font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">하시기 바랍니다.</span></font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\">&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\">1. </span></strong></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><strong style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\">대상자 </strong>: 재학 중 자퇴, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.4pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">미등록</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.4pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">·</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\">미복학 및 학사경고 누적 등의 사유로 제적된 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\">자</span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">2. 자격 제한</font></span></span></strong></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp; 가. 학생활동 등으로 제적된 자 중 개전의 정이 없는 자</font></span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp; 나. 학사경고로 제적된 후 1년(2학기)이 경과되지 아니한 자</font></span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font color=\"#ff0000\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; → 학사경고제적 1년 경과 후 재입학 가능</font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp; 다. 수학능력과 수업태도 등 학업활동을 계속할 수 없다고 판단되는 자</font></span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp; 라. 재입학 사실이 있는자 </span></span></font><font color=\"#ff0000\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\">→ 재입학은 1회에 한함</font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp; 마. 징계에 의하여 제적된 자 및 재학연한 초과자(재학연한은 수업연한의 2배)</font></span></span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">3. 신청 일정</font></span></span></strong></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp; 가. </span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><strong style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\">재입학원서 접수기간 및 신청장소</strong></span></font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; - </span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><strong style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\"><u><font color=\"#0900ff\">2017. 7. 11.(화) ~ 7. 13.(</font><font color=\"#0900ff\">목</font><font color=\"#0900ff\">)</font>, 해당 학사행정실</u></strong></span></font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp; 나. </span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><strong style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\">재입학 허가일(예정) : 2017. 7. 24.(월)</strong></span></font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><strong></strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp; - 합격자 조회는 '학교 홈페이지-원스톱서비스-학적부-학적자료조회'에서 확인 가능</span></font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;&nbsp; - 휴학 : 2017. 8. 28.(월) 개강 이후에 휴학 신청 가능(반드시 등록금을 납부하여야 함)</font></span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp; 다. 수강지도상담 기간</font></span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;&nbsp; - 2017. 8. 1.(화) ~ 8. 11.(금)</font></span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp; 라. 수강신청 기간</font></span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;&nbsp; - 2017. 8. 8.(화) ~ 8. 9.(수) 1학년, 4학년 이상</font></span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;&nbsp; - 2017. 8. 10.(목) ~&nbsp;8. 11.(금) 2학년, 3학년</font></span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp; 마. 등록 기간</font></span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;&nbsp; - 2017. 8. 22.(화) ~&nbsp; 8. 25.(금) </font></span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;&nbsp; - 등록금 고지서 출력방법 : <span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">원스톱서비스 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><!--StartFragment--></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">→ 등록 <span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">→&nbsp; 등록금고지서 조회/출력</span></span></font></span></span></span></p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p></span><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">4. 제출 서류 </span></span></strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\">: 붙임 [별표1, 2, 3] 참조 </span></font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><strong style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\">&nbsp; <u>가. 재입학 원서 1부</u></strong></span></font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp; <u>나. 학생 자필로 된 각서 및 학과장 추천서 각 1부</u></font></span></span></strong></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp; <u>다. 학적부 사본 및 성적증명서 각 1부</u></font></span></span></strong></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong></strong></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong></strong></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">5. 재입학 여석 인원 : 총 74명</font></span></span></strong></span></p><p><!--StartFragment--></p><table style=\"HEIGHT: 85px; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid; WIDTH: 591px; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; mso-table-overlap: never\"><tbody><tr><td valign=\"middle\" style=\"BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.7pt solid; HEIGHT: 33.3pt; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid; WIDTH: 61.29pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.98pt double; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.41pt; PADDING-TOP: 1.41pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.7pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt\" rowsp